WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:04.600
I came to this clinic on a recommendation,

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:10.200
I'd heard it was a good place that helps people who are struggling.

3
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:13.600
I have scoliosis, mainly in my lower back.

4
00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:15.800
I was born with it.

5
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:20.200
I came here and met Noam, an amazing guy, a real professional.

6
00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:23.400
He treated me on the electromagnetic bed,

7
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.400
and with needles.

8
00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:30.800
And I can tell you that after seven or eight treatments, I think,

9
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:34.100
I feel like a new man.

10
00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.900
I'd already tried a lot of places.

11
00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:39.500
I met a lot of charlatans along the way

12
00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:43.400
who just cost me money and didn't help. Here, really,

13
00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:48.800
I got all the help I needed. I'm very satisfied, and I warmly recommend it.

14
00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:53.300
And I'm not a partner here. It's not my business, I don't own the place.

15
00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:59.700
I just landed in a good place, and I enjoyed the treatment, the approach and the way they treat you.

16
00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:01.800
It's a pleasure here.
